Add independently observed mixer-source and callback service inputs.

The original captures changes between sources within one primary block.
Per-presentation sample progress cannot reproduce these interleavings.
The optional service input schedules actual mix steps and original callbacks;
all buffer controls come from the live engine, with recorded fields used only
as assertions. Ordinary playback retains its existing clock behavior.

